  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="price_clause">
        <p>Ego Bernardus de Cacciacontis, pro anima mea et pro anima patris mei et matris meae, dono monasterio Sancti Salvatoris de Montis Amiata pecora mea, videlicet oves centum et capras triginta, cum omnibus fetibus et lactibus eorum, ut monachi pro nobis missas celebrent et orationes fundant ad Dominum.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="penalty_clause">
        <p>Quod si aliquis heredum meorum vel extranea persona hanc donationem infringere voluerit, anathema sit et a communione fidelium separatus, et componat monasterio duplum quod donatum est, et haec carta donationis firma permaneat.</p>
      </div>
      <listWitness>
        <witness>
          <name>Ranierius de Berardenga</name>
        </witness>
        <witness>
          <name>Gerardus filius Ildebrandi</name>
        </witness>
        <witness>
          <name>Petrus de Piccolominis</name>
        </witness>
        <witness>
          <name>Ugo de Malavoltis</name>
        </witness>
      </listWitness>
    </body>
